# ---- build artifacts -----------------------------------------------------
# The index and embeddings live OUTSIDE the repo, at ~/voice-rag-artifacts,
# deliberately: 3.4GB, and a memory-mapped LMDB under a sync client corrupts.
# This entry only catches the case where someone recreates it in-tree.
artifacts/
*.faiss
*.npy
*.lmdb/
*.mdb

